        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>高中化学: 90+逆袭计划</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] } };\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #e9e9e9;\n    font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n  }\n  .toolbar {\n    background: #ffffff;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;\n  }\n  .toolbar-row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    padding: 6px 12px;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;\n  }\n  .toolbar-row .title {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n  .icons {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 16px;\n    color: #444;\n    font-size: 16px;\n  }\n  .icons span {\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 20px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .color-row {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 10px;\n    padding: 6px 12px;\n  }\n  .dot {\n    width: 16px;\n    height: 16px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    display: inline-block;\n    border: 1px solid #ccc;\n  }\n  .page {\n    background: #fff;\n    max-width: 640px;\n    margin: 10px auto;\n    padding: 18px 20px 40px 20px;\n    background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(\n      to bottom,\n      transparent 0px,\n      transparent 27px,\n      #eaeaea 28px\n    );\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    color: #111;\n  }\n  .item {\n    margin: 4px 0 8px 0;\n  }\n  .hl {\n    background: #fdf27a;\n  }\n  .hl-blue {\n    background: #cfe8f7;\n  }\n  .circle {\n    border: 1.5px solid #d33;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    padding: 0 6px;\n    display: inline-block;\n  }\n  .circle-inline {\n    border-bottom: 2px solid transparent;\n    border: 1.5px solid #d33;\n    border-radius: 40%;\n    padding: 0 4px;\n  }\n  .indent {\n    margin-left: 1.2em;\n  }\n  .sub {\n    margin-left: 1.5em;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"toolbar\">\n  <div class=\"toolbar-row\">\n    <div class=\"icons\">\n      <span>&#8592;</span>\n      <span>&#128269;</span>\n      <span>&#127908;</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"title\">高中化学: 90+逆袭计划</div>\n    <div class=\"icons\">\n      <span>&#9881;</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"toolbar-row\">\n    <div class=\"icons\">\n      <span>&#8634;</span>\n      <span>&#8635;</span>\n      <span>&#9998;</span>\n      <span>&#128465;</span>\n      <span>&#9998;</span>\n      <span>T</span>\n      <span>&#128279;</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"icons\">\n      <span>&#8599;</span>\n      <span>&#128278;</span>\n      <span>&#128465;</span>\n      <span>&#8943;</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"color-row\">\n    <span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#000;\"></span>\n    <span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#5a4634;\"></span>\n    <span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#e03c2e;\"></span>\n    <span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#f0932b;\"></span>\n    <span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#2f7fd8;\"></span>\n    <span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#7fd6f0;\"></span>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"item\">\n    31. 磷与氧气反应，氧气充足生成五氧化二磷，氧气<span class=\"circle\">不足</span>生成三氧化二磷。\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"item\">\n    32. 白磷分子式为P4，分子晶体，故12.4g白磷含有磷原子数目为0.4NA。\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"item\">\n    33. Cl2反应量Fe反应，无论铁过量还是<span class=\"circle\">不过量</span>，<span class=\"hl\">只有</span>生成氯化铁，只有溶液中铁才与氯化铁反应生产氯化亚铁\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"item\">\n    34. Al3++3AlO2- + 6H2O = 4 Al(OH)3。\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"item\">\n    35. 过量二氧化碳通入水玻璃中反应：<br>\n    2H2O+2CO2+Na2SiO3 = 2NaHCO3+H2SiO3↓二氧化碳<span class=\"hl\">不过量</span>生成碳酸钠\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"item\">\n    36. 比较半径大小：<br>\n    <span class=\"sub\">(1) 层数相同，核大半径小</span><br>\n    <span class=\"sub\">(2) 层同，核大半径大</span><br>\n    <span class=\"sub\">(3) 核同，价高半径小，例如铁大于二阶铁<span class=\"circle-inline\">大</span>于三阶铁</span><br>\n    <span class=\"sub\">(4) 电子层结构相同，核电荷数越大，半径越小。</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"item\">\n    37. C是形成化合物最多的元素，单质是自然界中硬度<span class=\"hl\">最大</span>的元素或气态氢化物中氢的质量分数最高的元素。\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"item\">\n    38. 元素气态氢化物能与它的氧化物在常温下反应生成该元素单质的S。这是高中很重要的化学反应，也是<span class=\"circle-inline\">唯一</span>体现二氧化硫具有氧化性的反应。<br>\n    2H2S+SO2=2H2O+3S\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"item\">\n    39. 元素的气态氢化物和它的最高价氧化物对应的水化物能反应生成盐的元素为N.\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"item\">\n    40. 单质在常温下呈液态的非金属元素为Br.\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"item\">\n    <span class=\"hl\">单质在常温下呈液态的金属元素为：Hg.</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"item\">\n    42. 3Mg+N2 = Mg3N2 &nbsp; 2Mg+CO2 = C+2MgO （条件都是点燃，别忘记<br>\n    哦，有物质在中间会出，如果认为镁与氮气不反应就是错误的。\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"item\">\n    43. 生铁、普通铁、不锈钢比碳重次降低。<span class=\"hl\">生铁</span>：生铁是含碳量大于2%的<br>\n    铁碳合金；钢：钢是含碳量在<span class=\"hl-blue\">0.04%-2.3%</span>之间的碳合金，不锈钢是Fe、<br>\n    Cr、Cr合金，Fe含量大约为<span class=\"hl-blue\">74.6%</span>。\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"item\">\n    44. 明矶净水的原因是利用水解原理，原理是明矶在水中可以电离出两种含<br>\n    属离子：KAI(SO4)2 = K+ + Al3+ + 2SO4²⁻而Al3+能容易水解，生成胶<br>\n    状的氢氧化铝Al(OH)3：Al3+ +3H2O ⇌ Al(OH)3(胶体) + 3H+ 氢氧化铝\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
